[281.806248, "o", "/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/CHANGELOG.md:185:- ⚠️ Moved the Create and Manage API rule checks out of the `OnRecordCreateRequest` hook finalizer, **aka. now all CRUD API rules are checked BEFORE triggering their corresponding `*Request` hook**.\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/CHANGELOG.md:187:    It could be a minor breaking change if you are relying on the old behavior and have a Go `tests.ApiScenario` that is testing a Create API rule failure and expect `OnRecordCreateRequest` to be fired. In that case for example you may have to update your test scenario like:\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/CHANGELOG.md:197:            \"OnRecordCreateRequest\": 1,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/CHANGELOG_8_15.md:332:    app.OnRecordBeforeCreateRequest(\"articles\").Add(func(e *core.RecordCreateEvent) error {\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/CHANGELOG_8_15.md:1309:      <td>On<strong>User</strong>BeforeCreateRequest() *hook.Hook[*<strong>User</strong>CreateEvent]</td>\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/CHANGELOG_8_15.md:1310:      <td>On<strong>Record</strong>BeforeCreateRequest() *hook.Hook[*<strong>Record</strong>CreateEvent]</td>\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:146:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreateRequest\":    3,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:151:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreate\":           3,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:152:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreateExecute\":    2,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:199:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreateRequest\":      3,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:203:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreate\":             3,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:204:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreateExecute\":      3,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:259:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreateRequest\":    1,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:260:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreate\":           1,\r\n/root/go/pkg/mod/github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase@v0.31.0/apis/batch_test.go:261:\t\t\t\t\"OnRecordCreateExecute\":    1,\r\n"]
